window.docContents[45].resolve({"/Lecture-1___-Motivation-and-Propositional-Logic/Worked-Examples/#Formal-Software-Verification--Lecture-1___-Motivation-and-Propositional-Logic--Worked-Examples--A-conjunction-entails-a-conjunct":{"contents":"Elimination projects the left conjunct, and the implication discharges the assumption P ∧ Q.\n\n   [P ∧ Q]\n  ──────────  ∧E₁\n      P\n  ────────────  →I\n   P ∧ Q → P\n\n\nexample (P Q : Prop) : P ∧ Q → P :=\n  fun h => h.left\n\n\nexample (P Q : Prop) : P ∧ Q → P := by\n  intro h\n  exact h.left\n\n\n","context":"Formal Software Verification\u0009Lecture 1: Motivation and Propositional Logic\u0009Worked Examples","header":"1.8.1. A conjunction entails a conjunct","id":"/Lecture-1___-Motivation-and-Propositional-Logic/Worked-Examples/#Formal-Software-Verification--Lecture-1___-Motivation-and-Propositional-Logic--Worked-Examples--A-conjunction-entails-a-conjunct"}});